      "title": "Thomas Markle, Meghan’s father, jailed after cutting off ankle monitor, DoJ says",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/thomas-markle-ankle-monitor",
      "description": "<p>Estranged father of Duchess of Sussex was arrested for keeping child sexual abuse material, authorities say</p><p>The estranged father of Meghan Markle, the Duchess of Sussex, has been jailed after US authorities said he cut an electronic monitoring device off his ankle, days after his arrest for keeping child sexual abuse material in storage units in California.</p><p>Thomas Markle, 82, was in custody awaiting a hearing in federal court in Tampa, Florida, first assistant US attorney Bill Essayli said. He was arrested shortly after he cut off the ankle bracelet at 1.45am on Tuesday, Essayli said.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/thomas-markle-ankle-monitor\">Continue reading...</a>",
